WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Aunt Song didn't react at all

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,780
It seems they don't know about fish yet

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,780
If you catch it, throw it away.

4
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:07,330
What are you bringing back?

5
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:21,420
Throw away what a waste you will do, of course, Lao Qin, come and sit down

6
00:00:23,430 --> 00:00:26,720
Don't mention it if Xiaoya didn't come back.

7
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:29,680
I haven’t come back since I left the country.

8
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:32,320
If it weren't for the phone calls from time to time

9
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:35,000
I even doubted if something happened to her over there.

10
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:41,960
Snake Soup is here. Uncle Qin hasn’t seen me for a long time. Do you still recognize me?
